      "message": "5.10 will be supported here for as long as the Android support rules say, I do not know the exact dates, sorry.\n\nFor new command line arguments, if you add them only to one branch, you then prevent anyone from updating to a newer kernel version UNLESS you also add the feature there as you are creating a new user/kernel api.  Please do NOT do that unless it is the only possible way.  For a hardware errata like this, it should not be needed at all and you can trigger off of the hardware platform description and not rely on the bootloader.",
